bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Notification Page" as UI
boundary Router
control NotificationController
control NotificationService
entity NotificationModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click "Delete notification"
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. DELETE /api/notification/delete-noti/{id}
activate Router

Router -> NotificationController: 3. deleteNoti(id)
activate NotificationController

NotificationController -> NotificationService: 4. deleteNoti(id, payload)
activate NotificationService

opt Invalid user
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: 4.1. BadRequestException
  NotificationController --> Router: 4.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 4.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 4.4. Show error
end

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 5. findOneAndDelete(_id, receiver_id)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 6. delete notification
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 7. delete result
deactivate MongoDB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: 8. return deleted notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService --> NotificationController: 9. success result
deactivate NotificationService

NotificationController --> Router: 10. HTTP response
deactivate NotificationController

Router --> UI: 11. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. Remove notification from list
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
